  "release_notes": "**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/jamixm4-crypto/natbypass/compare/v1.9.226-beta15...v1.9.226-beta16\n\n- Security Hardening & Vulnerability Remediation:\n  * Fix Critical HMAC Signature Bypass: strictly enforce 40-byte binary HMAC verification on all signaling beacons and tunnel IP frames when network key is active; reject unauthenticated plaintext JSON\n  * Prevent Peer Displacement / Session Hijacking: enforce WireGuard public key cryptographic binding in peer registry; reject spoofed beacon takeovers of active peers\n  * Eliminate DoS Panics: replace all CSPRNG panic(csprng failure) crashes across 8 modules with error returns and secure fallback entropy\n  * Harden TLS Verification: eliminate InsecureSkipVerify:true; bundle embedded ISRG Root X1 / DigiCert CAs for Keenetic/OpenWrt MIPS routers\n  * Upgrade pion/stun to v3.1.5: address CVE-2026-54909 DoS vulnerability",
